{
 "film": "in-this-town-monster-village-part-3",
 "fps": 30,
 "duration": 115.1,
 "estimated": true,
 "tempo": 1.0,
 "wordsPerMinute": 255.5,
 "audio": null,
 "clips": [],
 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.8333,
   "text": "In this town, I was the only one who was not a monster."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.friend",
   "start": 2.8333,
   "end": 5.6,
   "text": "My only human friend stayed behind, to face a whole army."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.found",
   "start": 5.6,
   "end": 8.1667,
   "text": "And all I found of him was a sword, and a helmet."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.pick",
   "start": 8.1667,
   "end": 10.3333,
   "text": "I picked the helmet up. It was still warm."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.arm",
   "start": 10.3333,
   "end": 11.9333,
   "text": "I was still holding my dad's arm."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.point",
   "start": 11.9333,
   "end": 13.7,
   "text": "And the arm was pointing at the ground."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.boots",
   "start": 13.7,
   "end": 15.1333,
   "text": "Boot prints. Hundreds of them."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.drag",
   "start": 15.1333,
   "end": 18.0,
   "text": "And in the middle, two long lines. Somebody had been dragged."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.straw",
   "start": 18.0,
   "end": 21.1333,
   "text": "Then I saw a bit of straw. And another. And another."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.trail",
   "start": 21.1333,
   "end": 24.0667,
   "text": "Mo was leaving me a trail. Or his hat was falling apart."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.hill",
   "start": 24.0667,
   "end": 25.7,
   "text": "It went all the way up the hill."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.camp",
   "start": 25.7,
   "end": 29.0333,
   "text": "On the other side was a camp. Tents. Fires. Players everywhere."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.sneak",
   "start": 29.0333,
   "end": 30.6333,
   "text": "I could not sneak past that many."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.think",
   "start": 30.6333,
   "end": 33.1,
   "text": "Then I thought: they are players. I look like a player."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.helmet",
   "start": 33.1,
   "end": 35.6,
   "text": "So I put on Mo's helmet. I picked up Mo's sword."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.walk",
   "start": 35.6,
   "end": 37.2333,
   "text": "And I walked in through the front gate."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.guard",
   "start": 37.2333,
   "end": 38.6,
   "text": "\"You are late,\" said the guard."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.sorry",
   "start": 38.6,
   "end": 39.5667,
   "text": "\"Sorry,\" I said."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.whose",
   "start": 39.5667,
   "end": 41.2333,
   "text": "He looked down. \"Whose arm is that?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.arm",
   "start": 41.2333,
   "end": 42.4,
   "text": "\"A trophy,\" I said."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.nice",
   "start": 42.4,
   "end": 44.3333,
   "text": "\"Nice,\" he said. And he let me in."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.map",
   "start": 44.3333,
   "end": 46.8667,
   "text": "Inside, they had a map of my village on a table."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.plan",
   "start": 46.8667,
   "end": 49.9,
   "text": "\"At sunrise,\" one said, \"we dig up everything east of the pond.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "5.tent",
   "start": 49.9,
   "end": 52.2333,
   "text": "The biggest tent was at the back. I went in."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.mo",
   "start": 52.2333,
   "end": 55.4,
   "text": "There was a cage. And in it was Mo. No hat. No scarf."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.not",
   "start": 55.4,
   "end": 56.9667,
   "text": "\"You should not be here,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.same",
   "start": 56.9667,
   "end": 58.6667,
   "text": "\"You would have done the same,\" I said."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.wrong",
   "start": 58.6667,
   "end": 62.0333,
   "text": "\"I would have done it better. You have my helmet on the wrong way round.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "6.key",
   "start": 62.0333,
   "end": 64.3,
   "text": "The key was on a hook, high up on the pole."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.reach",
   "start": 64.3,
   "end": 65.9667,
   "text": "I jumped. I could not reach it."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.arm",
   "start": 65.9667,
   "end": 68.7,
   "text": "So I held up my dad's arm. And the arm took the key."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.thanks",
   "start": 68.7,
   "end": 69.8,
   "text": "\"Thanks, Dad,\" I said."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.steps",
   "start": 69.8,
   "end": 71.2333,
   "text": "Then I heard steps behind me."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.big",
   "start": 71.2333,
   "end": 74.1333,
   "text": "It was the big player. The one who had lifted his sword at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.froze",
   "start": 74.1333,
   "end": 76.6333,
   "text": "I did not move. He did not even look at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.mo",
   "start": 76.6333,
   "end": 77.5667,
   "text": "He looked at Mo."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.years",
   "start": 77.5667,
   "end": 80.0333,
   "text": "\"Ten years,\" he said. \"Ten years I have looked for you.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "7.him",
   "start": 80.0333,
   "end": 82.4333,
   "text": "\"And I did not come for you. I came for him.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "7.baby",
   "start": 82.4333,
   "end": 83.8333,
   "text": "\"Where is the baby you took?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "7.silent",
   "start": 83.8333,
   "end": 84.7,
   "text": "Mo said nothing."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.turn",
   "start": 84.7,
   "end": 86.8,
   "text": "Then the big player turned round, and looked at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.off",
   "start": 86.8,
   "end": 87.8667,
   "text": "\"You. Helmet off.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "8.took",
   "start": 87.8667,
   "end": 89.8667,
   "text": "I took it off. It went very quiet."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.his",
   "start": 89.8667,
   "end": 91.4333,
   "text": "Then he took off his own helmet."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.face",
   "start": 91.4333,
   "end": 93.4667,
   "text": "He had my face. Older. But mine."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.son",
   "start": 93.4667,
   "end": 94.3,
   "text": "\"Son,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.mo",
   "start": 94.3,
   "end": 95.9667,
   "text": "\"Do not listen to him,\" said Mo."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.ask",
   "start": 95.9667,
   "end": 97.2333,
   "text": "\"Ask him why I took you.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "9.wait",
   "start": 97.2333,
   "end": 99.1,
   "text": "I looked at the big player. I waited."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.nothing",
   "start": 99.1,
   "end": 100.1667,
   "text": "He did not answer."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.shake",
   "start": 100.1667,
   "end": 101.0667,
   "text": "Then the ground shook."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.out",
   "start": 101.0667,
   "end": 102.3667,
   "text": "I looked out of the tent."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.ring",
   "start": 102.3667,
   "end": 104.9,
   "text": "My whole village was standing in a ring around the camp."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.in",
   "start": 104.9,
   "end": 106.6,
   "text": "And this time, they were facing in."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.mum",
   "start": 106.6,
   "end": 109.4333,
   "text": "My mum was at the front. \"Give me back my son,\" she said."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.two",
   "start": 109.4333,
   "end": 112.0667,
   "text": "The big player drew his sword. \"He is my son,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.me",
   "start": 112.0667,
   "end": 113.3667,
   "text": "And they both looked at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.sub",
   "start": 113.3667,
   "end": 115.1,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part four."
  }
 ],
